;Description
:This template is used to link to a DeviantArt profile.
;Syntax
:Place <code><nowiki>{{Deviantart|<username>|description*}}</nowiki></code> and substitute <username> with the latter part of the Utaite's Deviantart Profile link. If necessary, use the article's talk page to discuss further details.

;Example<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:<pre>{{Deviantart|jubyphonicp|Juby Phonic's DeviantArt description}}</pre>

;Will result in<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:{{Deviantart|jubyphonicp|Juby Phonic's DeviantArt description}}

;note<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:description field is optional.

